#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:880
msgid ""
"This is the call volume for each output. The level applies automatically "
"when a call connects and whenever the output changes during a call, and "
"slider changes are heard live. The hardware applies levels in coarse steps, "
"and the earpiece never goes fully silent. The Bluetooth level is stored for "
"upcoming routing support."
msgstr ""
"Oyo ezali mongongo ya kobenga mpo na esika moko na moko ya kobimisa "
"mongongo. Nivo etiamaka yango moko ntango libengi ekangami mpe mbala nyonso "
"oyo esika ya kobimisa mongongo ebongwani na ntango ya libengi, mpe mbongwana "
"ya curseur eyokamaka mbala moko. Masini etiaka ba nivos na matambe minene, "
"mpe eyokelo ya litoi etikalaka nyɛɛ mobimba te. Nivo ya Bluetooth ebombami "
"mpo na lisungi ya routage oyo ekoya."

